</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 6:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you get the chance go read the thread on the Zodiac in comparison, Ed brings up a great point about the similaries between Rader and Zodiac in numbers Z was 7 and 17 I think Rader was 3 and 13<!--/Text--></td></tr>
